  "notes": "USAGE:\n{落選|らくせん} is the opposite of {当選|とうせん}.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・{落選|らくせん}する (to lose/not be selected)\n・{落選|らくせん}{者|しゃ} (unsuccessful candidate; loser)\n・{落選|らくせん}{通知|つうち} (notification of not being selected)\n・{落選|らくせん}{運動|うんどう} (negative campaign)\n\nNOTES:\n{落選|らくせん} carries a somewhat stronger sense of failure compared to simply \"not winning.\" The kanji {落|らく} (fall) conveys the idea of falling short.",
